WEBVTT

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:07.440
Bye, Emi!

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.780
Yeah, see you tomorrow!

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:15.790
I can't wait for the Vanguard regionals!

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:18.350
Let's stand in line first thing in the morning, 
so we can get good seats!


00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:22.000
I'm gonna get the Cardfighter of the 
winning team to take a look at my deck!

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:55.010
It's just too bad we didn't make it...

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:57.980
Next time, we just gotta win 
at the shop's tournament!

00:01:57.980 --> 00:01:59.340
Yeah!!

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.600
Hello!

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:13.820
Oh, hello there.

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:17.090
I think Aichi and the 
others will be here soon.

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:18.180
Good.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:19.380
Hello.

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:29.500
Huh? You're interested in Vanguard?

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.550
Eh? Um...

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:34.040
Not especially...

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:35.940
I mean, it's difficult, right?

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:38.200
Oh, I wouldn't say that.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.460
Huh...

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:41.760
Would you like to try it?

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:49.730
Suspenseful?! Emi's First Fight

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:56.060
Oh, yeah! I'm feelin' 
super-strong again today!

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:57.940
You're sure in a good mood, Morikawa.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.980
Yep! My horoscope says I'm 
gonna have a great day!

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:03.050
Oh yeah?

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:04.040
Hey!

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:08.060
Let's see... Morikawa's 
horoscope for today...

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:10.730
13th place out of the 12 constellations?!

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:13.500
Hey, that sounds like the 
lousiest luck to me...

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.650
You do not look at my 
bible without permission!


00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:19.030
Anyway, you were looking in the wrong place!

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:20.550
It's right here.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:24.910
Um... "You possess a winning smile."

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:28.460
Keep reading!

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:32.150
"With that smile, you may be 
respected by your juniors."

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:37.620
You hear that?! I'll be respected!

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:38.730
Respected!

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.830
Huh... By your juniors...

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:46.670
Good afternoon.

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:48.860
Er... Welcome.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:50.340
Thanks.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.310
I'll just go in.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:53.450
Thank you!

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:54.360
Huh?

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:57.340
Wha...?

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:58.850
Aichi!

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:00.810
Emi! You're here?

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:05.900
Aichi, it seems that Emi wants 
to start playing Vanguard!

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:06.470
Huh?

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.780
Really, Emi?

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.980
N-Not especially, and I told him that!

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:17.440
Let's go over to a standing fight table.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:18.130
Eh?

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:21.250
I have adjusted it to your height.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:24.110
I-I don't even have any cards...

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:28.950
Misaki! We need a deck at 
this table, if you would!

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:31.200
You don't have to crow about it!

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:34.580
Here.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:37.030
You can borrow my deck.

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:39.290
Oh! B-But...

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:45.300
Um, your fighting partner should be...

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:47.570
Your big brother, Aichi.

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:50.890
I get it! It meant you!

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:53.740
Yo, Junior!

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:54.060
Eh?

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.310
Excuse me?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:57.100
Don't hold back!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.070
Aichi is my number one pupil!

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:02.670
It's my duty to take care of my 
number one pupil's little sister!

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:04.940
Uh... Aichi...

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:06.540
Do your best, Emi!

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:10.480
But I don't really understand the rules...

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:14.640
It'll be fine. This is how I 
was taught Vanguard, too...

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:15.900
...by Kai.

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:17.220
Why, you...

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:17.790
Huh?

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:21.890
Don't remind me of that show-off!

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:24.680
Uh, that's not what I was trying to do...

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:29.300
Relax! Unlike that Kai clown, I'm the strongest nice guy around!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.510
If you say so.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:44.780
First, shuffle the deck.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:47.150
L-Like this?

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:50.300
What do you think of my ultimate shuffle?!

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:53.160
I don't really see the "ultimate" in it.

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.370
All right!

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.210
Then you cut each other's decks.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.210
Like this?

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:01.970
Don't show me the card you 
chose for the Vanguard circle, okay?

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:02.630
Okay.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.490
All-righty, I'm gonna draw 
five cards from my deck.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:07.380
Watch me now.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:16.350
1-2-3-4-5!

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:18.900
Get ready, Junior!

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:19.350
I'm ready!

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:23.140
Master Morikawa's one-point lecture!

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:25.650
With only your first hand, if there 
are any cards you don't need,

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.470
you can discard them and draw again.

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:31.590
You've gotta go, and this one, too...

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:33.280
I'm drawing three new cards!

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:35.200
There we go!

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:39.460
Master Morikawa doesn't need any cards 
in his hand that're grade 2 or less!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.010
Even though it was a surprisingly good hand...

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.510
Oh, how cute!

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:48.510
But I don't need these two.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.460
This one's cute, too!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.840
You like your cards? Good!

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:59.280
I'm all ready.

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:00.720
Imagine!

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:06.230
Right now, you and I are astral bodies that 
have appeared on Cray, a planet much like Earth!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.200
Morikawa, Kai says the same thing.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:09.780
W-W-What?!

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:13.360
O-Oh yeah?! Then he must be ripping me off!

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:15.170
The planet Cray...

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:19.120
It's beautiful!

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:21.700
Beautiful?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.080
Hey! Where are you?!

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:27.140
Really?! Here?!

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:29.170
Please, Junior, keep up with me!

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:32.090
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.220
Lozenge Magus!

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.240
Lizard Runner, Undeux!

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:42.410
He's scary!

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:47.250
Give me your best shot, Junior! Master 
Morikawa is your sparring partner today!

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:50.290
I wonder if Miss Emi is here today?

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:53.030
And if Kai happens to be there, too...

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:56.450
Miss Emi I can understand, but 
why do you care about Kai?

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:58.040
WK, yo?!

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:04.330
I attack with Asura Kaiser!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.540
Finishing Hold!

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:10.270
That was wonderful, Kamui!

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:13.310
Um... I have a favor to ask...

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:15.390
What is it, my goddess?

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:18.580
Please teach me how to play Vanguard!

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:21.140
Are you sure you want me for the job?

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:23.350
Please, Kamui!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:27.970
I know Emi would be in good hands with you!

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:30.520
Would you do it for me, Kamui?

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:38.530
Great Kamui?!

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:41.040
Brother Aichi!

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:43.360
Kamui?!

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:46.640
What is this?! What the 
heck's going on here?!

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:48.330
W-What's going on?

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:50.950
Emi's playing Vanguard for the first time...

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:53.430
Why did it have to be with 
Lose-umi, of all people?!

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:57.090
With him! This is the worst day of my life!

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:58.470
Shut up!

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:03.010
I-I'm sorry!

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:04.610
She beat me to the punch...

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:07.880
Please excuse us!

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.670
EU, yo!

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:13.470
Once a cardfight starts, it can't be stopped!

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:14.990
CS, yo!

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.440
My...

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.270
My dream is...

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:20.330
My turn. I draw!

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:22.580
All right, a grade 3!

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:27.450
Sorry, Junior, but this 
is a fight to the finish!

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:28.740
I ride...

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:30.180
Huh?

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:35.480
Crap! My hand is so strong that 
I don't have any cards to ride!

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:40.610
She's...with Lose-umi...with Lose-umi!

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:43.100
Miss Emi is...!!

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.060
Poor Great Kamui!

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:46.990
PK, yo!

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:50.450
Um... It's my turn and I draw.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:51.720
Miss Emi...

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:58.240
Nothing to worry about. Even if it's her 
first time, I just know she'll blow Lose-umi away!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:01.670
This one's cute, so I'll ride it!

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:09.230
You decide by how cute it is?!

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:10.330
Is that bad?

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:13.020
You'd be better off choosing a powerful Unit

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:16.420
or a Unit that has a skill you 
can use in the Vanguard Circle!

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:17.300
Kamui...

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.830
I don't mind if you teach her the rules...

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:24.560
But it's a breach of manners to instruct 
her to use your personal style of play.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.640
But FT, yo!

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.600
It is Miss Emi's first time...

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:34.360
That's all the more reason. I want her 
to experience the pleasure of winning

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:37.440
through her own discernment, 
discovering the thrill of the fight!

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:40.660
That's how it was the first 
time for you guys, right?

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.560
Yeah.

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:42.240
Yep.

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:49.970
No problem. As long as you're 
having fun, Miss Emi...

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.710
In that case...

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.370
All I can do is watch...

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:57.510
Miss Emi has her own style of play.

00:10:57.710 --> 00:11:00.560
But Lose-umi, I'll never 
forgive you for this!

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:03.450
And one of these days, it'll be payback time!

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:06.180
I can put this in the back, right?

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.040
Mm-hm.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.180
All right, then!

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:13.320
I, um...call Dream Eater!

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:19.010
Then I use Lozenge's power to boost Milk...

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:21.340
...and Milk attacks Undeux!

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:26.080
You know, if you boost with 
Lozenge, it returns to the deck.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.250
Really?! Then I won't do it!

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.440
You're not gonna do it?!

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:33.630
Great Kamui!

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:37.750
I-If Miss Emi is happy with 
that, it's okay with me!

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:41.370
Do a trigger check.

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:42.120
Yeah!

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:45.480
I got another cute one!

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:48.420
Dammit! No trigger, huh?

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:49.570
Great...

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.710
Oh, by the way, what's a trigger?

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:56.450
Hm? Um...

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:58.150
Go ahead.

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:01.240
I-I can help you with that...

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:04.650
Look at your Lozenge Magus there.

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:08.830
It's got... I mean, <i>she's</i> got a mark 
above her and to the right, right?

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:11.010
Oh, I see it!

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:15.710
When you attack or when you take damage, 
if another card with that mark comes up,

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:19.290
your power could increase or 
your damage could be boosted,

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:22.030
or you could even be healed 
after taking damage.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.010
Uh...

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.000
Good for you, oh Great Kamui!

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:27.310
GY, yo!

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:30.250
Well, this class is about to draw to a close.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.970
It's my turn and I draw!

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:50.430
I'll show you that this is 
the Age of the Morikawa!

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:53.160
Grade 1 kept me waiting long enough!

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:56.590
You're the one who put it back
 in the deck at the beginning!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:00.710
I ride the Embodiment of Armor, 
Bahr -- ultimately!

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:04.770
Then I call the Embodiment 
of the Spear, Tahr!

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:08.230
And now I'm gonna attack 
the Weather Girl, Milk!

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:09.650
Oh!

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:10.950
Miss Emi, guard!

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:11.770
Nooo!

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.450
What the...?!

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:16.030
Certainly, that's a great guard!

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:20.400
But, if this girl is attacked, 
she'll disappear, right?!

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:23.130
No, the Vanguard doesn't go away.

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:24.280
Really?

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:26.160
I still don't want her to be attacked!

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:30.670
If you don't wanna take any damage, then 
you oughta protect it with a guardian.

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:33.620
No, even with that, it's still too cruel...

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:34.610
If I may...

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:38.580
Your Vanguard cards and Units...

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:42.130
They do battle on the planet Cray in place of you, the Cardfighters.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:44.300
There's a pact between you.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:48.840
Maybe it would help if you thought 
of it as a sport, like boxing.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.560
A sport?

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:51.720
I see...

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:54.180
In that case, I'll take the attack.

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:58.140
Miss Emi is so kind...

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:00.230
That's my goddess!

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:01.520
Yep!

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:05.230
All right! Here to throw another 
wet blanket over the mood...

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:07.610
I do a super-strong attack with Bahr!

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:16.040
I, um...stand and draw!

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:18.750
I ride Maiden of Libra!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.210
She attacks Bahr!

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:25.170
Oh, no you don't! I guard with Bahr!

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.930
Oh no...

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.560
Emi, do a trigger check.

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:33.420
Okay. Um...

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.260
Drive trigger check!

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:37.060
What?!

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.520
There it is!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.530
Critical trigger!

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:45.390
Miss Emi, you get +5000 
power and do damage +1!

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:55.310
Dammit!

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.340
Why am I so unlucky?!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:01.760
Even though this is your first time playing 
Vanguard, you're drawing great cards, Miss Emi!

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:03.970
You've hit the jackpot!

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:06.780
The goddess of victory is smiling on you!

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:07.960
Mm-hm!

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:11.520
Huh! Then I'm doing pretty well...

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:18.700
If you've got the goddess of victory, then 
the goddess of fortune is on my side!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.350
Horoscope

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:21.340
Even though there's a guy on the cover...

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:23.360
The stars know everything!

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:27.040
Aichi's little sister! Today, 
I'm going to beat you!

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:30.080
It's your destiny to respect me!

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:34.800
My turn! I draw!

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.740
Here it is, grade 2!

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:40.340
I ride the Dragon Knight, Nehalem!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:45.710
Then I attack your Libra with 
Nehalem, boosted by Tahr!

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.070
Drive trigger check!

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.340
No trigger...

00:15:57.170 --> 00:16:03.420
Aichi's little sister, in the next turn, 
something terrible is going to happen to you.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:07.700
Brace yourself for Master 
Morikawa's ultimate...

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.290
Now it's my turn, right?

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:10.150
Listen when a guy talks!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.420
Jeez...

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:14.860
Actually, you're the weird 
one for intimidating a child!

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:17.620
For my turn, I draw!

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:22.980
Mmm, Apollon isn't cute, so I 
don't think I want to ride him.

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:26.020
I know! I'll have these two attack!

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:28.380
I call Chocolat!

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:30.380
And one more...

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.970
I attack Nehalem!

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:39.470
You won't use Lozenge, no matter what, huh?

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.980
Great Kamui...

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:46.080
Is that all you've got?!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.860
Drive trigger check!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:50.130
Another cute one!

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:52.540
Dream Eater's barrage attack!

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:55.000
Chocolat girls, please give me a boost!

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.200
Not bad...

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:11.490
5 damage? Never thought you'd
 trap me in a corner like that...

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:14.690
Of course, you <i>are</i> the little 
sister of my number one pupil!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:18.060
But it's the end of the line! Here I go!

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:20.670
Master Morikawa draws for 
his super-strong turn!

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.430
Here comes my star performer!

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:26.970
I ride Juggernaut Maximum -- ultimately!

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:31.230
Note: If you don't have any other unit of the same clan, power is lowered to 9000.

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:34.990
Move it! If you're not grade 3,
 I have no use for you!

00:17:35.510 --> 00:17:39.580
Look upon the valiant 
figure of Master Morikawa!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:41.140
That's really mature of you～

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:44.380
Monster Frank! Tyrant Deathrex!

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:48.530
Demon Eater! Stealth Dragon 
Voidmaster! Hell Spider!

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:51.360
I call them all together -- ultimately!

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:54.970
How do you like them apples?! 
They're all grade 3!

00:17:54.970 --> 00:18:00.050
Meet the ultimate, extreme Morikawa 
corps, equipped with twin drive skill!

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:04.390
Only the Vanguard can use twin drive...

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.820
Only units with the ability can boost...

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:10.280
What is Lose-umi doing?

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:12.410
Mmm, this is getting interesting...

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.560
Maximum does an ultimate attack!

00:18:19.770 --> 00:18:22.690
Twin drive... I got it!

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:24.290
Critical trigger!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.440
And even more damage!

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:29.780
What's wrong? You want me to hold back?

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:33.830
Um...You can't use that card 
without a Kagero, right?

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:34.340
Uh...

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.520
Mm?

00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:38.380
Well, Tahr's a Kagero...

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:42.580
Move it! If you're not grade 3,
 I have no use for you!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:45.000
I have no use for you! No use! No use!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.560
Crap!

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:50.250
But Master Morikawa isn't the kind of guy 
who loses his head over something like that!

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:52.830
I attack with my Monster Frank and Deathrex!

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.830
That's the end of my turn.

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:03.370
Morikawa, you look scary!

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:06.250
Then it's my turn!

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:10.760
I ride CEO Amaterasu!

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:16.380
Eh? You're not giving up yet?

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:18.890
Excellent! Give me all you got!

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:23.110
I call Libra and the Oracle Guardian, Nike!

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:29.650
Amaterasu attacks Maximum!

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:31.780
Tahr puts up his ultimate guard!

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:40.230
How do you like that?! Your 
attack didn't go through!

00:19:40.230 --> 00:19:42.910
Twin drive... I need you!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.210
Please!

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:48.310
Let me have it!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.120
Yayyy!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.310
Draw trigger?!

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:55.290
+5000 power!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.130
And one more card drawn, to boot!

00:19:57.130 --> 00:20:02.090
Amaterasu's skill says that, if there are four 
or more cards in hand, the fighter gets +4000...

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:03.960
10000 + 4000...

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:06.280
And +5000 on top of that, for a total of...

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:07.970
19000 power!

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:09.580
Then...

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:11.560
It's too powerful for me to defend against!

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:23.810
Her first time playing Vanguard
 is also her first victory!

00:20:23.810 --> 00:20:25.310
That's my Miss Emi!

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:26.520
You were awesome!

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:28.290
AE, yo!

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:32.360
Emi, that was great. Congratulations.

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:34.280
Thank you!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:41.420
Why?! I had the super-strong 
Morikawa corps...

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.630
Are you okay, Morikawa?

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:46.190
I've got it! The reason I lost...

00:20:46.190 --> 00:20:48.800
...is that my star sign had 
the lowest rank for today!

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:51.060
That's it! There's no doubt about it!

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.190
Yeah, yeah...

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:56.610
But it was off about you being 
respected by someone your junior.

00:20:56.610 --> 00:21:00.310
That is strange. Impossible 
for it to be wrong, but...

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:01.330
Um...

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:02.040
Huh?

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.130
I had a lot of fun!

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:06.830
Thank you very much, Mr. Morikawa, sir!

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:07.430
Eh...?

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:09.190
Sir!

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:14.950
Well, what can I say?

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:17.700
My bible was right on target after all!

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:21.750
Yep, you've been really lucky to have a 
super-strong guy like me around to show you the ropes!

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:25.590
Oh, get your head outta 
your butt, Lose-umi!

00:21:25.980 --> 00:21:28.260
The name is Ka-tsu-mi!

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:30.670
I say it's Lose-umi!

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:32.410
Ka-tsu-miii!!

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:34.800
Well, he is super-strong, in a way...

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:35.940
Yee-up.

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:36.980
Aichi!

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:37.610
Hm?

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:40.480
Next time, I wanna try to make my own deck!

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:43.150
When it comes to deck 
construction, leave it to me!

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:45.040
What, is it your turn next?

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:45.650
Hah?

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:50.650
Okay. I suppose you can also be 
the junior of Master Morikawa.

00:21:50.650 --> 00:21:53.290
W-Who the heck would wanna 
be the junior of Lose-umi?!

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:56.470
"Junior"... I like the sound of that.

00:21:56.470 --> 00:21:58.480
All right, imagine!

00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:01.240
Please do it, Great Kamui!

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:02.420
PK, yo!

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:05.700
Next time, can I bring a friend?

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:08.350
Of course! We'll give them a warm welcome.

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:09.930
Good for you, Emi.

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:10.800
Yeah!

00:22:13.210 --> 00:22:15.600
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:22:16.220 --> 00:22:18.140
Stand up!

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:53.110
Did you have a good time, Emi?

00:23:53.110 --> 00:23:53.650
Yeah!

00:23:53.650 --> 00:23:57.730
Since this was my first time, I wonder 
if Mr. Morikawa went easy on me?

00:23:57.730 --> 00:24:00.410
Um...I think he might've...

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:04.630
Oh, Kamui says he wants to 
teach you Vanguard too, Emi.

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:08.090
Sure. Aichi, you'll give me free 
lessons when we get home, won't you?

00:24:08.090 --> 00:24:09.290
On the house?

00:24:10.590 --> 00:24:13.340
Next time: Team Q4 Heads for 
the Regional Tournament!

00:24:13.340 --> 00:24:16.610
The Vanguard Regional Championship 
Tournament begins at last!

00:24:16.610 --> 00:24:18.550
Huh? Where are the manager and Misaki?
